  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3211.04 Quarterly Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3211.04 Quarterly Reporting.\n\n(a) Budget sources subject to 40 CFR 75 shall submit the data required pursuant to Env-A 3211.02 and Env-A 3211.03 to EPA as part of the quarterly reports submitted to EPA for the purpose of compliance with 40 CFR 75.\n\n(b) Budget sources not subject to 40 CFR 75 shall submit quarterly reports to EPA within 30 days from the end of each of the second and third calendar quarters.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
